Package: agora
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Agora desktop environment - runtime
 Agora is a desktop environment for Linux and the BSDs: a Cocoa-compatible
 stack (Core Foundation, Foundation, Core Graphics, Core Text and the
 Application Kit), a window server, and the desktop's content, built from a
 set of pinned component revisions.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries and programs.

Package: agora-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: agora (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Agora desktop environment - development files
 Headers, CMake package configs and pkg-config files for building programs
 against the Agora stack.
